    "rationale": "Model accepted for preliminary screening use at MRL 3 with conditions: designs predicted to exceed 1150K by more than 50K are rejected at concept review without physical test, while designs within +/-50K are flagged marginal and must proceed to engine ground test; model output is not used for final blade life assessment or certification-facing analysis at this MRL. Conditions for MRL 4 readiness include tip-region mesh convergence study, probabilistic UQ on engine COU peak temperature, and resolution of the film cooling validation gap.",
